    "点一下色块，标出今天上的是哪一天，整个日历就按它排好。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点一下色块，标出今天上的是哪一天，整个日历就按它排好。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a block to mark which day today is. The whole calendar follows from it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點一下色塊，標出今天是哪一天，整個行事曆就照它排好。"
